 \, new connections\, and exceptional dining\, hosted in part by The ’Qui
 n House’s Art Curator\, Kate Chertavian. Bringing her expertise and pass
 ion for the arts to the table\, Kate will help guide conversations that ma
 y explore everything from The ’Quin’s own art collection to the broade
 r world of art and culture\, inviting fresh perspectives and meaningful ex
 changes along the way.\n\nOver a beautifully curated three-course dinner w
 ith expertly paired wines\, members will have the opportunity to share sto
 ries\, exchange ideas\, and get to know one another beyond the everyday. S
 ettle in for an evening where engaging dialogue\, great food\, and good co
 mpany come together.\n\n*Tickets are $100 per person\, plus tax\, and are 
 reserved for members only. Cancellations within 72 hours of the event\, or
