BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-211490@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20261120T143000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261120T160000
SUMMARY:‘Quin Chat: Inside the Exhibition with Alexandre Gallery
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 12 spots left\nS
 tatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/21149
 0\n\nJoin us in The Reading Room for a ’Quin Chat exploring the artists\
 , influences\, and connections behind our fall exhibition. Phil Alexandre\
 , President & Director of Alexandre Gallery\, joins artists Tessa Greene O
 ’Brien and Meghan Brady for a conversation moderated by The ’Quin’s 
 art collection curator\, Kate Chertavian\, offering fresh perspectives on 
 the works on view throughout the ’House.\n\nSpanning the Lobby\, Grand S
 taircase\, and Reading Room\, the exhibition features 25 works on loan thr
 ough Alexandre Gallery\, including paintings by Lois Dodd\, Loren MacIver\
 , Pat Adams\, Tessa Greene O’Brien\, Lisa Sanditz\, Meghan Brady and Emi
 ly Nelligan. Together\, we will explore how these artists translate the wo
 rld around them through distinct approaches to color\, form\, landscape\, 
 and abstraction - and consider the shared influences and individual vision
 s that connect their work across generations.\n\n*This event is compliment
 ary and reserved for members\, plus one guest. Complimentary light bites
  and refreshments will be served. Cancellations made within 24 hours of th
 e event\, or failure to attend\, will result in a $25 charge.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/211490
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
